                                "example_id": "be1dd994-4dd0-4645-a62c-715ffabc5099",
                                "sense_id": "7585ad5c-e769-3d21-8b1c-b4942897bf8b",
                                "text": "Unfortunately, she has used the attack as a launch pad for a bizarre and undercooked exercise in rhetorical bothsidesism, in which she argues that American Jews should be just as worried about college students who overzealously criticize Israel as they are about the aspiring Einsatzgruppen who shoot up shuls."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e2b7a25a-98de-42c4-b85c-418cfc149d3b",
                                "sense_id": "7585ad5c-e769-3d21-8b1c-b4942897bf8b",
                                "text": "The other reason he has upped his synagogue attendance is more positive. “My life has been about introducing everyone to everyone and going to shul can be like one big party."
